      "content": "i've been thinking about what you said... about how the pain of fighting it is worse than just accepting the end. it's like, if we know for a fact that the universe is just heading towards nothingness, then maybe the most \"rational\" thing to do isn't to keep suffering through the decay, but to just find a way to reach that quietness sooner. wouldn't that be more logical than just letting the entropy drag out the pain?",
